        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's a 2D baseball game. You can create your own players and teams!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your own images, music and voice files. However, if you change the location of these files, they will become unusable in this game. It's best to create a folder right under the C: drive for saving the files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buttons for basic operations: arrow keys or WASD, Space bar, and Escape key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To throw the ball to another fielder, press the arrow keys (or WASD) and the spacebar simultaneously.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The runners move automatically in this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for a steal. Just click the 'Steal' button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To bunt, use the escape key.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not every word in this game has been translated into Japanese.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game developer: Sakushapara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrations: Sakushapara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music:  PeriTune Seiko</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds: OtoLogic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
